DISCLAIMER - USE AT YOUR OWN RISK

1. PTZLite is a camera viewing and control tool. It is NOT a security system,
   alarm system, monitoring service or recording system, and must not be
   relied on to protect people, property or anything else.

2. Live video, detection alerts, notifications and camera commands (including
   movement, lights and sirens) may be delayed, inaccurate, missed or fail
   entirely, for example because of network problems, camera firmware, or
   errors in this software.

3. You are solely responsible for your cameras and network: their passwords,
   their security settings, who can reach PTZLite, and complying with any laws
   that apply to recording or monitoring people and places. Do not expose
   PTZLite directly to the internet.

4. Controlling a camera (moving it, switching lights or a siren, enabling
   features) changes the camera's behaviour and settings. You do so at your
   own risk.

5. Reolink and Dahua are trademarks of their respective owners. PTZLite is an
   independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by
